evels and become a mutated death god. unlock secret character or two. find secret artifacts. play the game in a few different ways with different characters. its neat. \n\nthe biggest downside is that i never figured out how to do the port forwarding crapp to get into multiplayer. the second biggest downside is the lack of enemy variety. most of them just run up to you to try to hit you. but i can forgive.", "timestamp_created": 1549967220, "timestamp_updated": 1549967220, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48944917", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042130030", "personaname": "Fungus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042130030/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5267, "last_played": 1695932734, "avatar": "ce4920e47e99f767f947b1c8fbcaa2d12790d64c"}, "language": "english", "review": "An infinitely replayable experience. Mysterious and challenging. I want more lore for this game!", "timestamp_created": 1549965172, "timestamp_updated": 1549965172, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528282225131988525", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}